  "description": "OEDRO drop running boards will be perfectly compatible with the 2022-2026 Toyota Tundra Crewmax Cab. Three-tube design provides more protection for the bottom and the side of the car, also preventing it from getting stuck on the rocker plate or hanging obstacles.\nFeatures\n6-inch side pedals. The two-level layout provides better convenience for vehicles equipped with lifting kits and oversized tires.\nThree-tube design. The three-tube design provides more protection for the bottom and sides of the vehicle while preventing it from getting stuck on the rocker or hanging obstacles.\nBolt-fixed installation. Welded brackets provide extra strength without cutting or drilling.\nstrong and sturdy. The unique powder coating has anti-rust and corrosion resistance, so it can be driven under any conditions.\nlaser cutting. The tread step surface is enhanced and anti-skid and grip.\n1-year warranty. For your safety, professional installation is recommended.\nFitment\nCompatible with 2022-2026 Toyota Tundra Crewmax Cab.\nNot fit to power-deploying running boards（Platinum / TRD Pro Trims Optional）",
